*** Settings ***
Documentation    Starter suite generated by Robotstudio.
Library    Collections
Suite Setup    Log    Robotstudio demo started
Test Teardown    Log    Test finished

*** Variables ***
${GREETING}    Hello from Robotstudio

*** Test Cases ***
Log A Greeting
    [Documentation]    A minimal smoke test written with the canvas model.
    [Tags]    demo    smoke
    Log    ${GREETING}
    Should Be Equal    ${GREETING}    Hello from Robotstudio

Build A List
    [Documentation]    Create a list and iterate over it.
    [Tags]    demo
    ${items} =    Create List    alpha    beta
    FOR    ${item}    IN    @{items}
        Log    ${item}
    END
    Length Should Be    ${items}    2

Conditional Check
    [Documentation]    Branch on a value and use a user keyword.
    [Tags]    demo
    ${value} =    Set Variable    7
    IF    ${value} > 5
        Log Twice    Value is large
    ELSE
        Log Twice    Value is small
    END
    Should Be True    ${value} == 7


*** Keywords ***
Log Twice
    [Arguments]    ${message}
    [Documentation]    Log the same message twice.
    Log    ${message}
    Log    ${message}

Count To
    [Arguments]    ${limit}
    [Documentation]    Count upwards, then prove the loop ran.
    ${count} =    Set Variable    0
    FOR    ${index}    IN RANGE    1    ${limit}
        ${count} =    Evaluate    ${count} + 1
    END
    TRY
        Should Be Equal As Integers    ${count}    ${limit}
    END
